              "type": "str",
              "value": "Fludd's 1621 anti-Kepler reply and Kepler's 1621 cosmological reissue were both printed by Erasmus Kempffer; Kepler's 1622 Apologia and Fludd's later reply remained in closely overlapping Frankfurt production networks.",
              "raw_value": "Fludd's 1621 anti-Kepler reply and Kepler's 1621 cosmological reissue were both printed by Erasmus Kempffer; Kepler's 1622 Apologia and Fludd's later reply remained in closely overlapping Frankfurt production networks.",
